{"title":"2025 Halloween Event","slug":"2025_Halloween_Event","pageid":4487,"revid":20474,"timestamp":"2025-11-11T02:44:36Z","lastEditor":"Krispychickenz","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<p>The <b>2025 Halloween Event</b> (aka <span title=\"Version 1.93.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmVyc2lvbl8xLjkzLjA/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Version 1.93.0</span>) was released on October 4th, 2025. With this update came many new changes, including <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Monstrous Manor</a>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Catseye/\">Catseye</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spider_Tree/\">Spider Tree</a>. It also included the comeback of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blood_Moon/\">Blood Moon</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candycorn/\">Candycorn</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>\nCategorized Additions\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Add\n</td>\n<td>Location\n</td>\n<td>Category\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</th>\n<th>Taiga\n</th>\n<th>Shop\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moon_Shard/\">Moon Shard</a>\n</td>\n<td>Everywhere\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ghosts/\">Ghosts</a>\n</td>\n<td>Everywhere\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pumpkin/\">Pumpkin</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay Island</a> and drops from <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pumpkinhead/\">pumpkinhead</a> mobs\n</td>\n<td>Loose Item\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Halloween Rewards\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Daily_Rewards/\">Daily Rewards</a>\n</td>\n<td>UI\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blood_Moon/\">Blood Moon</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay Island</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>\n</td>\n<td>Event\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod/\">Hardened Moon Rod</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</td>\n<td>Event\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"trees\">Trees</h3>\n<p>The following trees have been added to the game\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hallow_Tree/\">Hallow Tree</a>\n</td>\n<td>Skeleton Meteor crash sites along with Bone trees\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Weeping_Willow/\">Weeping Willow</a>\n</td>\n<td>All over the map\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Spider_Tree/\">Spider Tree</a>\n</td>\n<td>All over the map\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Acacia/\">Corrupt Acacia</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupted_Cactus/\">Corrupted Cactus</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"Corrupted Palm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29ycnVwdGVkX1BhbG0/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Corrupted Palm</span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupted_Wanwood/\">Corrupted Wanwood</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupted_Kelp/\">Corrupted Kelp</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Deadwood/\">Corrupt Deadwood</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h3 id=\"ores\">Ores</h3>\n<p>The following ores and stones have been added to the game\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Catseye/\">Catseye</a>\n</td>\n<td>Near <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Monstrous Manor</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span title=\"Corrupted Blackstone (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29ycnVwdGVkX0JsYWNrc3RvbmU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Corrupted Blackstone</span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupted_limestone/\">Corrupted limestone</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Corrupt_Biome/\">Corrupt Biome</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Candycorn/\">Candycorn</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drops from mobs, also in Candycorn area in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sweetstone/\">Sweetstone</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"}
